Also my emotions have been all over the place

00:00:47,790 --> 00:00:50,190
since this has been going on.

00:00:51,350 --> 00:00:55,750
Well, there is some emotional issues with passing parasites

00:00:55,750 --> 00:00:58,030
for some people because they're like,

00:00:58,030 --> 00:01:00,390
oh my gosh, it's just the anxiety

00:01:00,390 --> 00:01:02,430
of the passing parasites.

00:01:02,430 --> 00:01:06,510
